## ✅ Common Patterns

1. Use spacing and sizing tokens from the theme
2. Use semantic colour tokens
3. Build mobile-first and extend up
4. Use reusable components
5. Apply consistent animation timing

---

## 🚫 Avoid

- ❌ Hardcoded hex colours
- ❌ Using `className` with Chakra
- ❌ Inline CSS instead of style props
- ❌ Animating layout properties
- ❌ Overstacking Liquid Glass components
- ❌ Ignoring accessibility controls

